{"info": {"author": null, "author_email": "Gal Kleinman <gal@traceloop.com>, Nir Gazit <nir@traceloop.com>", "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": [], "description": "# OpenTelemetry CrewAI Instrumentation\n\n<a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/opentelemetry-instrumentation-crewai/\">\n    <img src=\"https://badge.fury.io/py/opentelemetry-instrumentation-crewai.svg\">\n</a>\n\nThis library allows tracing agentic workflows implemented with crewAI framework [crewAI library](https://github.com/crewAIInc/crewAI).\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install opentelemetry-instrumentation-crewai\n```\n\n## Example usage\n\n```python\nfrom opentelemetry.instrumentation.crewai import CrewAIInstrumentor\n\nCrewAIInstrumentor().instrument()\n```\n\n## Privacy\n\n**By default, this instrumentation logs prompts, completions, and embeddings to span attributes**. This gives you a clear visibility into how your LLM application is working, and can make it easy to debug and evaluate the quality of the outputs.\n\nHowever, you may want to disable this logging for privacy reasons, as they may contain highly sensitive data from your users. You may also simply want to reduce the size of your traces.\n\nTo disable logging, set the `TRACELOOP_TRACE_CONTENT` environment variable to `false`.\n\n```bash\nTRACELOOP_TRACE_CONTENT=false\n```\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": null, "home_page": null, "keywords": null, "license": null, "license_expression": "Apache-2.0", "license_files": null, "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "opentelemetry-instrumentation-crewai", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/opentelemetry-instrumentation-crewai/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/opentelemetry-instrumentation-crewai/", "project_urls": {"Repository": "https://github.com/traceloop/openllmetry/tree/main/packages/opentelemetry-instrumentation-crewai"}, "provides_extra": ["instruments"], "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/opentelemetry-instrumentation-crewai/0.63.1/", "requires_dist": ["opentelemetry-api<2,>=1.38.0", "opentelemetry-instrumentation>=0.59b0", "opentelemetry-semantic-conventions-ai<0.6.0,>=0.5.1", "opentelemetry-semantic-conventions>=0.63b1", "crewai<2,>=1.0.0; extra == \"instruments\""], "requires_python": "<4,>=3.10", "summary": "OpenTelemetry crewAI instrumentation", "version": "0.63.1", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "release_dates": {"0.36.0": "2025-01-16T04:04:23.483589Z", "0.37.1": "2025-01-25T21:45:52.601577Z", "0.38.0": "2025-02-04T07:21:09.268579Z", "0.38.1": "2025-02-04T10:35:39.412865Z", "0.38.10": "2025-03-05T14:21:36.137985Z", "0.38.11": "2025-03-06T09:58:40.031132Z", "0.38.12": "2025-03-07T20:27:30.244729Z", "0.38.2": "2025-02-04T13:25:14.225865Z", "0.38.3": "2025-02-05T15:42:45.318083Z", "0.38.4": "2025-02-06T13:03:19.580650Z", "0.38.5": "2025-02-10T14:38:15.955018Z", "0.38.6": "2025-02-17T09:32:55.919803Z", "0.38.7": "2025-02-19T08:49:28.044718Z", "0.38.8": "2025-02-27T10:42:48.843825Z", "0.38.9": "2025-03-04T17:10:04.668460Z", "0.39.0": "2025-03-25T10:20:15.742758Z", "0.39.1": "2025-04-15T06:34:20.600746Z", "0.39.2": "2025-04-18T16:52:42.271641Z", "0.39.3": "2025-04-24T13:36:15.856126Z", "0.39.4": "2025-04-28T11:27:47.060778Z", "0.40.0": "2025-04-30T09:28:31.208129Z", "0.40.1": "2025-04-30T09:38:08.527065Z", "0.40.10": "2025-06-17T11:07:28.618590Z", "0.40.11": "2025-06-17T19:00:29.721721Z", "0.40.12": "2025-06-20T19:15:48.777156Z", "0.40.13": "2025-06-24T06:11:50.615685Z", "0.40.14": "2025-06-24T10:25:47.625707Z", "0.40.2": "2025-04-30T10:00:52.600577Z", "0.40.3": "2025-05-07T11:49:24.412206Z", "0.40.4": "2025-05-10T10:08:24.342187Z", "0.40.5": "2025-05-13T19:28:33.044453Z", "0.40.6": "2025-05-16T14:38:53.814060Z", "0.40.7": "2025-05-20T15:04:18.112884Z", "0.40.8": "2025-06-09T00:22:18.334274Z", "0.40.9": "2025-06-10T09:54:02.153627Z", "0.41.0": 